       "@type": "Review",
       "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
       },
       "reviewBody": "Hi Jen! Love this recipe and have made it many, many times. Soon I have to make rice for a crowd of about 20-25. I've read that cooking rice in the oven is a good way to make large quantities. Do you recommend that method? And would you use the same ratio of rice/water/butter/salt, just scaled up? Any tips you have would be appreciated!\r\n\r\nAs always, LOVE your website and own both your cookbooks - thank you! You are so talented!",
       "author": {
