        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
       },
       "reviewBody": "I made this last night. I normally use my instant pot and have that recipe down but I needed this to be stovetop. It was great. I made it with chicken stock because I was putting it into a casserole and added some Italian seasoning and it was fantastic.",
